# nginx configuration. Prettier has no nginx parser, falls back to reflowing it
# as prose, and the result is not a config file any more: `#` comment prefixes
# are dropped mid-comment and directives are joined onto one line, so nginx
# reads a word out of a sentence as a directive and refuses to start. Found by
# `nginx -t` failing on an include this had silently rewritten.
deploy/**/*.conf
deploy/**/*.inc
